{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-letsvan-fuzzy-trendy-fun-party-doll-2510-0160","content_id":"cb023aeb-6e2d-4956-87e6-1cb7c4250710","description":"Product Safety Report for Letsvan Fuzzy Trendy Fun Party Doll presenting a serious risk of choking.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"7a2ade42-3c15-4569-aa16-a26611c32e80","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2025-12-23T10:59:00+00:00","id":"7a2ade42-3c15-4569-aa16-a26611c32e80","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2025-12-23T10:59:00+00:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/694a75f41a2e540ccd8a54c2/2510-0160-product-safety-report-letsvan-fuzzy-doll.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Letsvan Fuzzy Trendy Fun Party Doll</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a serious risk of choking as the keyring, plastic hands, and feet can detach creating small parts.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The product is no longer available for sale.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Toys – Dolls/Soft Toys (Non-Powered)</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Letsvan</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Barcode</td>\n      <td>6974773055557</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Letsvan soft filled pink doll, approx 160mm high, with removable hat. The box includes a soft bodied doll, keyring attachment and silver coloured bracelet with an inner packaging.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_7a2ade42-3c15-4569-aa16-a26611c32e80\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/694a75f41a2e540ccd8a54c2/2510-0160-product-safety-report-letsvan-fuzzy-doll.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a serious risk of choking as the keyring, plastic hands, and feet can detach creating small parts. These small parts pose a choking hazard to young children, particularly those under 36 months of age who have a natural tendency to explore objects by placing them in their mouths. If the hands or feet detach, it is also possible for children to access the fibrous stuffing, which may also present a choking risk. Improvements are also required to product labelling and marking.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the Toys (Safety) Regulations 2011.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The product is no longer available for sale.</p>\n\n<p>Consumers are advised to stop using the product immediately and seek redress from their place of purchase.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2510-0160</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2025-12-23T15:29:34Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-safety-report","product_category":"toys","product_measure_type":["other"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2025-12-23","product_risk_level":"serious"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2025-12-23T15:29:34+00:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-report